  objective: "C\u1EA7m th\xF9ng qua \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng t\xE0u, \u0111\u1EB7t l\xEAn
    c\u1EA7n c\u1EEDa; r\u1ED3i mang th\xF9ng th\u1EE9 hai l\xEAn b\xE0n \u0111\u1EA1p
    t\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EC3 m\u1EDF c\u1ED5ng ga ph\u1EE5 (G14,6)."
  startLine: "T\xE0u v\u1EABn \u0111\xFAng gi\u1EDD. Ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 anh l\xE0 \u0111i
    l\u1EC7ch l\u1ECBch."
  tierUpLines:
  - 
  - "L\u1ECBch t\xE0u \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111i\u1EC1u ch\u1EC9nh. T\xE0u
    s\u1EBD ch\u1EA1y s\u1EDBm h\u01A1n."
  - "T\xF4i nh\u1EDB anh \u0111\xE3 \u0111i l\u1ED1i n\xE0o. T\xF4i s\u1EBD \u0111\u1EE3i
    \u1EDF \u0111\xF3."
  ghostLine: 
  zones:
  - name: L2_HanhLang
    fromTime: 0.5
    toTime: 3
    hint: "H\xE0nh lang ph\u1EE5 (l\xE0n xa G0,5\u2013G3) l\xE0 l\u1ED1i c\u1EE5t:
      v\xE0o l\u1EA5y M\u1EA3nh nh\u1EDB th\xEC ph\u1EA3i l\xF9i v\u1EC1 G0,5 m\u1EDBi
      ra \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c. L\xF9i \u0111\u1EE7 2 gi\xE2y l\xE0 m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n
      tua \u2014 t\xE0u s\u1EBD ch\u1EA1y s\u1EDBm h\u01A1n."
  - name: L2_TrainZone
    fromTime: 3
    toTime: 7.5
    hint: "T\xE0u ch\u1EA1y \u1EDF l\xE0n g\u1EA7n. C\u1EA7m th\xF9ng r\u1ED3i chuy\u1EC3n
      sang l\xE0n xa (W) \u0111\u1EC3 tr\xE1nh t\xE0u."
  - name: L2_Bien
    fromTime: 7.5
    toTime: 10
    hint: "Bi\u1EC3n hi\u1EC7u r\u01A1i \u1EDF l\xE0n nh\u1EDB \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      (v\xF2ng \u0111\u1ECF). \u0110\u1ED5i l\xE0n \u0111\u1EC3 tr\xE1nh, ho\u1EB7c
      b\u1EA5m Space \u0111\u1EC3 nh\u1EA3y qua bi\u1EC3n \u0111\xE3 r\u01A1i."
  - name: L2_Phu
    fromTime: 10
    toTime: 16
    hint: "Mang th\xF9ng \u1EDF G11 (l\xE0n g\u1EA7n) sang l\xE0n xa, \u0111\u1EB7t
      l\xEAn b\xE0n \u0111\u1EA1p t\u1EA3i G13,2 \u0111\u1EC3 m\u1EDF c\u1ED5ng G14,6.
      Bi\u1EC3n r\u01A1i \u1EDF G12,3 v\xE0o l\xE0n NH\u1ECAP nh\u1EDB (v\xF2ng \u0111\u1ECF)."
