  ghostSpeedFactor: 0.6
  maxGhostRecordings: 1
  twoGhostLine: 
  fragmentsCompleteLine: "Chuy\u1EBFn t\xE0u \u0111\xF3 kh\xF4ng c\xF3 trong l\u1ECBch.
    V\u1EADy m\xE0 anh v\u1EABn gi\u1EEF v\xE9."
  fragments:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db77d71ef0208649a2727eb6e676307, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: da18226d4ab83064881828670d22815e, type: 2}
  solution: "1) Nh\u1EB7t th\xF9ng \u1EDF G2 (l\xE0n g\u1EA7n, tr\xEAn ray).\n2)
    \u0110\u1ED5i sang l\xE0n xa \u0111\u1EC3 tr\xE1nh t\xE0u (G3\u2013G7).\n3) \u0110\u1EB7t
    th\xF9ng l\xEAn c\u1EA7n c\u1EEDa \u1EDF l\xE0n xa (G9) \u2014 c\u1EEDa m\u1EDF.\n4)
    \u0110i qua c\u1EEDa t\u1EDBi th\xF9ng th\u01B0. N\u1EBFu bi\u1EC3n hi\u1EC7u
    \u0111\xE3 r\u01A1i ch\u1EAFn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng: Space \u0111\u1EC3 nh\u1EA3y
    qua. Th\xF9ng b\u1ECB t\xE0u h\u1EA5t s\u1EBD t\u1EF1 H\u1ED3i v\u1ECB v\u1EC1
    ch\u1ED7 c\u0169.\n5) (v3.1) S\xE2n ga ph\u1EE5: nh\u1EB7t th\xF9ng 2 \u1EDF
    G11 (l\xE0n g\u1EA7n), qua G12,3 \u1EDF l\xE0n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 v\xF2ng \u0111\u1ECF,
    \u0111\u1ED5i sang l\xE0n xa v\xE0 \u0111\u1EB7t th\xF9ng l\xEAn b\xE0n \u0111\u1EA1p
    t\u1EA3i G13,2 \u2014 c\u1ED5ng G14,6 m\u1EDF. T\u1EDBi th\xF9ng th\u01B0 cu\u1ED1i
    G15,6.\nT\xF9y ch\u1ECDn: ngay t\u1EEB \u0111\u1EA7u, \u0111\u1ED5i sang l\xE0n
    xa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc G0,5 \u0111\u1EC3 v\xE0o h\xE0nh lang ph\u1EE5 (2 M\u1EA3nh
    nh\u1EDB: v\xE9 t\xE0u c\u0169 G1,6, b\u1EA3ng gi\u1EDD t\xE0u b\u1ECB g\u1EA1ch
    G2,85). H\xE0nh lang c\u1EE5t n\xEAn ph\u1EA3i l\xF9i v\u1EC1 G0,5 (l\u1EA7n
    tua \u2192 NH\u1ECAP b\u1EADc 1, t\xE0u ch\u1EA1y s\u1EDBm h\u01A1n)."
